  "validity": "Genuine ReactOS _strtoi64 C source with __REACTOS__ and _LIBCNT_ host defines, plus the shipping cnt-rust _strtoi64 shim, cstr_slice helper, and core_rs::radix module. Input is a non-null NUL-terminated ASCII string and base is one of 0, 2, 3, 8, 10, 16, or 36; these avoid the source's invalid-base precondition path. The pointer-slot argument may be NULL or address a valid char* output cell. Decimal and radix text may exceed i64 and exercise the C saturating behavior. Locale is unused in this build. No non-ASCII ctype or Windows ABI behavior is claimed.",
